<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>VICODIN</ttm:title>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">1nonly</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:item type="album">VICODIN</ttm:item>
      <ttm:item type="spotify_id">1k6NRe4Vh0vjcEJiVARB4Q</ttm:item>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold"/>
      <style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:11.573" end="00:15.844" ttm:agent="v1">Uh, uh, uh, uh, uh, uh</p>
      <p begin="00:15.844" end="00:17.750" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, okay</p>
      <p begin="00:17.750" end="00:20.164" ttm:agent="v1">Uh, uh, uh, uh</p>
      <p begin="00:20.164" end="00:22.537" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:22.537" end="00:25.094" ttm:agent="v1">Faded— Faded as a b***h, I think I might just take a trip</p>
      <p begin="00:25.094" end="00:28.087" ttm:agent="v1">Take a flight up to Japan, before I land I take a sip</p>
      <p begin="00:28.087" end="00:30.879" ttm:agent="v1">Perky in my ****in’ system, what the **** a Vicodin?</p>
      <p begin="00:30.879" end="00:33.660" ttm:agent="v1">This that money told that people roll the camera, flashin’ shit</p>
      <p begin="00:33.660" end="00:36.569" ttm:agent="v1">I’m on the run, yeah, I’m on the run, boy, I’m one and done</p>
      <p begin="00:36.569" end="00:39.213" ttm:agent="v1">I got guns, kickin’ like a drum, do this shit for fun</p>
      <p begin="00:39.213" end="00:42.206" ttm:agent="v1">Up and stuck, he need medicine, light this ****in’ blunt</p>
      <p begin="00:42.206" end="00:45.040" ttm:agent="v1">N’ keep it shut, pressure to the lungs, I can’t get enough</p>
      <p begin="00:45.040" end="00:46.540" ttm:agent="v1">Boy, I’ll blow your ass away</p>
      <p begin="00:46.430" end="00:47.930" ttm:agent="v1">Keep the police out the case</p>
      <p begin="00:47.811" end="00:50.496" ttm:agent="v1">Sippin 40’s, O.G told me smoke an O.Z to the face</p>
      <p begin="00:50.496" end="00:53.391" ttm:agent="v1">In the sun, I see thе rain, in the front, I see them rings</p>
      <p begin="00:53.391" end="00:58.259" ttm:agent="v1">And the choppa do еm’ dirty, need to wash them ****in’ stains</p>
      <p begin="00:58.259" end="01:02.585" ttm:agent="v1">&quot;No one, you're all alone, huh? Like me, blondie&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:02.585" end="01:04.085" ttm:agent="v1">Proud of all my decisions, uh</p>
      <p begin="01:03.615" end="01:05.115" ttm:agent="v1">Word to the mind, I’m in it, get buck and the fye</p>
      <p begin="01:04.968" end="01:07.827" ttm:agent="v1">Put him in the sky, just like I’m a flight attendant</p>
      <p begin="01:07.827" end="01:10.338" ttm:agent="v1">Everything I want, I got it, had to step into the finer things</p>
      <p begin="01:10.338" end="01:13.551" ttm:agent="v1">Had to get from the rougher times to breakin’ the bread with all my kin</p>
      <p begin="01:13.551" end="01:15.051" ttm:agent="v1">B-B-B***h I’m steppin’ with this ruger</p>
      <p begin="01:14.570" end="01:16.155" ttm:agent="v1">Take a step and I might shoot ya</p>
      <p begin="01:16.155" end="01:17.655" ttm:agent="v1">Windows tinted, can’t see in it</p>
      <p begin="01:17.482" end="01:18.982" ttm:agent="v1">Swimmin’ up in a pile of jewels</p>
      <p begin="01:18.932" end="01:20.432" ttm:agent="v1">Independent how I live</p>
      <p begin="01:20.222" end="01:21.722" ttm:agent="v1">That’s the life I went to choose</p>
      <p begin="01:21.713" end="01:23.213" ttm:agent="v1">I’m a star like golden goose</p>
      <p begin="01:23.117" end="01:25.968" ttm:agent="v1">Yo’ music ass won’t look into it</p>
      <p begin="01:25.968" end="01:27.468" ttm:agent="v1">[Bridge]</p>
      <p begin="01:26.585" end="01:28.874" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Won’t look into)</p>
      <p begin="01:28.874" end="01:32.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Loo-loo-loo-look into it)</p>
      <p begin="01:32.450" end="01:34.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Won’t look into it)</p>
      <p begin="01:34.700" end="01:36.413" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Loo-loo-loo-look into it)</p>
      <p begin="01:36.413" end="01:37.913" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Faded-ed-ed)</p>
      <p begin="01:37.152" end="01:38.687" ttm:agent="v1">Faded as a b***h, I think I might just take a trip</p>
      <p begin="01:38.687" end="01:41.503" ttm:agent="v1">Take a flight up to Japan, before I land I take a sip</p>
      <p begin="01:41.503" end="01:44.348" ttm:agent="v1">Perky in my ****in’ system, what the **** a Vicodin?</p>
      <p begin="01:44.348" end="01:47.047" ttm:agent="v1">This that money told that people roll the camera, flashin’ shit</p>
      <p begin="01:47.047" end="01:49.965" ttm:agent="v1">I’m on the run, yeah, I’m on the run, boy, I’m one and done</p>
      <p begin="01:49.965" end="01:52.729" ttm:agent="v1">I got guns, kickin’ like a drum, do this shit for fun</p>
      <p begin="01:52.729" end="01:55.458" ttm:agent="v1">Up and stuck, he need medicine, light this ****in’ blunt</p>
      <p begin="01:55.458" end="01:59.458" ttm:agent="v1">N’ keep it shut, pressure to the lungs, I can’t get enough</p>
    </div>
